<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
    <PropertyGroup>
        <TargetFrameworks>net461;netstandard2.0;net6.0</TargetFrameworks>
        <Version>1.0.0-beta-02</Version>
        <InfomationalVersion>1.0.0</InfomationalVersion>
        <PackageReleaseNotes>Integrate GPI RNG (#206917)</PackageReleaseNotes>
        <Description>
        New bet list for GPI RNG

The result link should call this Javascript function: "showGPIBetDetails(transId, 'winlostDate', custId, transactionType);", which transactionType is:

- 1, if the status is Won, Lose, Draw, or Refund

- 2, if the status is Reject, or Void

- 3, if the status is Running, or Waiting

- otherwise, 0</Description>
